      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b65fa918ad44b982eeeb01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员！\n为了庆祝我要跳舞了。就现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef61e47100477088d695051aca4f6475c96ffc045e285ab7742da4c98e23bcba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fcbf36b8ff8ac3b7a2585f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊～没想到会突然流鼻血……\\n不过既然都赢了，也算是有个圆满的结果吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4505e7f34e8beeb23028079328eb7fc0bbcff922f324c1dbea5b9f5ecdd7b17b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9710e4cc6e776af5a2c7031f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀。是以前群访时见过的面孔呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "112192339edae5dec368927799763d2e8e5b0a2df98ae72246310f8062a48f9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1230"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d9bcb21e0fc117f61eb23e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "——矿石，就是要用矿石来打磨。\n只要一起度过时光，自然就会变得更加锐利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7a7a0867d9403b0b0fd3b0fa569445287d77ab004ca5a0a03ca3b0002c744f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:017266cc359e5748a748ce03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种程度。想要『削弱』我，还差得远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03949990ba8c189ebdd777a450af5a1c4880d6bf0fe340e104e878953e900053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1232"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f5990fe4df87ca03663f0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让各位看到的——\n我将对手彻底压碎，取得胜利的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55c9702e792d5501e86d877bcefc19d9262c089e4121e44e6cfc00a082c059c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4720f96d07a1d969fae07d81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待各位在决赛的表现哦。\n——作为点缀我胜利的，装饰品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd1583864dccfb572715494c5d6afd2b4e173eac175a2506d33c7e016116410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c54fd233f1263c06d12fd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种程度。想要『削弱』我，还差得远呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03949990ba8c189ebdd777a450af5a1c4880d6bf0fe340e104e878953e900053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1235"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d3b7ac0d548fe1a79214b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会让各位看到的——\n我将对手彻底压碎，取得胜利的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b55c9702e792d5501e86d877bcefc19d9262c089e4121e44e6cfc00a082c059c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1236"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64754ab9a65e35ec957f6817",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很期待各位在决赛的表现哦。\n——作为点缀我胜利的，装饰品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd1583864dccfb572715494c5d6afd2b4e173eac175a2506d33c7e016116410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
